assLoader`/`InMemoryDexClassLoader`/`getCodeCacheDir`/`getAssets().open`, payload class name string | `v2-dexloader-payload-invoke` prebuild; manual: jadx both dexes, javac them together with the Context stub | high: d20 set as v2 is due in Mastery |\n201\t| 102 | v2 chain reads raw bytes from ANOTHER APK of the install (split asset via `ApplicationInfo.splitSourceDirs`/`sourceDir` + `java.util.zip.ZipFile`, `AssetManager.open`, `createContextForSplit`) | seen D26 (`Assets.readSplit(\"huntress_feature.bin\")`: 16 B -> 2 big-endian u64 folded in `Util.mergeFeature*`) | bytes of a member entry folded into the token | dex refs `splitSourceDirs`, `Ljava/util/zip/ZipFile;`, `getEntry`, `getInputStream`, `readSplit`, a `[B` reader taking an asset name | manual: `unzip -p feature.apk assets/<name> \\| xxd`, port the chain; timed: `v2-split-asset-read` prebuild | certain: TT/Mastery repeat today |\n202\t| 103 | Code in a feature split (split `classes.dex`, `isolatedSplits` split ClassLoader, `SplitCompat`/`SplitInstallManager`) | gap (D26 feature split had `hasCode=false`) | static long fn in the split's dex invoked from base via `createContextForSplit(name).getClassLoader().loadClass` or reflection | feature manifest `hasCode=true`, split `classes.dex`, base `android:isolatedSplits`, `<uses-split>`, `com/google/android/play/core/splitinstall` | jadx each split; javac them together; `split-feature-dex-code` prebuild | high: natural D26 TT/Mastery mutation |\n203\t| 104 | Config-split selection (ABI / density / locale splits; only the device-matching one is installed) | gap (D26 prompt says \"configuration splits\"; only a feature split shipped) | value from the split matching the pinned x86_64 emulator / default density / `en`; other splits = decoys | `split_config.x86_64.apk`, `split_config.arm64_v8a.apk`, `split_config.xxhdpi.apk`, `split_config.en.apk`, manifest `configForSplit`, `split=\"config.x86_64\"` | `unzip -l` all members; `aapt2 dump xmltree`; `split-config-devi