he race; never gate on \"v2 now\".\"\"\",\"\"\"- **Escalation is not monotonic** (d21 `reverse` after d20's pointer; d23-d26 singles still v1; **d27 dropped v2 from\n  TT and from all 11 Mastery sets** after 4 days of v2; **d28 brought it straight back**). Keep every v1 decoder first in\n  the race and the v2 evaluator always armed; never gate on \"v2 now\" or \"v1 now\".\n- **Substring luck is not a parser** (d28 `packet`): `ANS-` search over the hex-decoded frame worked only because the\n  payload was plaintext. For a framed codec, parse header/length/checksum and fullmatch the PAYLOAD.\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"- **Escalation watch:** d27's \"dependency flaw reachable from an exported surface\" may return as real code\"\"\",\"\"\"- **Escalation watch:** d28's \"nonce and ordering semantics\" may turn real: several frames with seq/nonce fields out of\n  order + a replayed duplicate + a bad-checksum decoy, nonce-keyed payload xor, u16/varint lengths, CRC16/CRC32,\n  `ByteBuffer`/`DataInputStream` parsing in the v2 chain. d27's \"dependency flaw reachable from an exported surface\" may return as real code\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"  prebuilt). Mastery solve 0.40 s for 11 v1 sets (d27); keep per-set cost flat as sets grow +1/day.\"\"\",\"\"\"  prebuilt). Mastery solve 0.40 s for 11 v1 sets (d27), 0.78 s for 12 v2 sets (d28); keep per-set cost flat as sets\n  grow +1/day.\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nwc -l reference/techniques/mobile-android.md"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1957,"cache_read_input_tokens":112869,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1957},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d21e4ad2-2ce4-4150-a62f-2e8aa1a9e184","uuid":"6e838afa-5a