{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GEsPZJ6T8gkMVnMHGZbbfJ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# mobile-android — technique log (days 1-28; updated after every day)\n2\t\n3\tHow the lane has looked so far (observations, not guarantees):\n4\t- **Timed variants MUTATE** (organizer, Day 8: \"new, dynamic variations/mutations ... new unseen effects\"): nothing below is a\n5\t  guarantee for Time Trial / Mastery -- solvers derive structure and degrade per field.\n6\t- Every APK so far was the same ~12.7 KB fixture: `AndroidManifest.xml`, `assets/huntress_puzzle.json`, `classes.dex`,\n7\t  `META-INF/FIXTURE-.{SF,RSA}`, `MANIFEST.MF` (6 entries). Extras: d10 `res/xml/network_security_config.xml` +\n8\t  `resources.arsc` (8 entries); d15-d16 `lib/x86_64/libarena.so` (7 entries); d20 `assets/payload.dex` (508 B plain dex).\n9\t  d21 the only manifest with `android:debuggable=\"true\"`. One question, `answer` = `ANS-` + 16 uppercase hex.\n10\t  **d26 first non-APK container**: `*.apks` = stored zip of `base.apk` (the usual fixture) + `feature.apk` (8.5 KB,\n11\t  manifest `split=\"arena_feature\"`, `hasCode=false`, one asset) in ALL three modes (Mastery: today's set only; d27 the\n12\t  d26 Mastery set KEPT its `.apks` container, now v1).\n13\t- Each day has a new Android IPC/security THEME, written in the manifest `<meta-data android:name=\"huntress.mechanic\">`\n14\t  and in dex constants (`DAY-NN:<theme_id>:<mechanic>` tag or `CONTROL`/`STRUCTURAL` fields): exported Activity, deep\n15\t  link, nested Intent, PendingIntent, allowBackup, ContentProvider, JS bridge, cleartext, trust manager, NSC, prefs,\n16\t  SQLite, Keystore, nonce d14, `jni_secret` d15, `jni_length` d16, `identifier_obfuscation` d17, `string_decryption` d18,\n17\t  `reflective_dispatch` d19, `dynamic_dex` d20, `anti_debug` d21, `root_detection` d22, `hook_detection` d23,\n18\t  `emulator_detection` d24, `integrity_signal` d25, `split_apk` \"base and feature split correlation\" d26,\n19\t  `legacy_dependency` \"reachable challenge-owned dependency\" d27, `binary_protocol` \"binary protocol framing\" d28. Through d22 the theme was flavour only (stub classes never needed). **Since d23 TT/Mastery\n20\t  COMPUTE the answer in dex code**; the theme is one pure-arithmetic gate fn inside that chain. **d26 = first chain that\n21\t  READS ARTIFACT BYTES at runtime** (16 B from the feature split via `splitSourceDirs` + `ZipFile`).\n22\t- Puzzle JSON v1 (`schema: huntress.mobile.puzzle.v1`, d1-d24 single, d1-d22 TT/Mastery): the answer sits behind a\n23\t  rotating `codec` (plain, reverse, base64, xor+key, split, hex, caesar+key, native, indexed, reflection, dynamic =\n24\t  pointer to `assets/payload.dex`; old codecs recur: d21 reverse, d22 base64, d23 xor, d24 split, d25 hex, d26 split\n25\t  with a fragment in the feature split, d27 base64 x5; NEW d28 `packet` = hex of a framed message). Keys re-roll.\n26\t- **Puzzle JSON v2 (d23-d26 + d28 TT and every Mastery set; d27 NONE -- all modes and all 11 sets back to v1; d28 back in\n27\t  TT and 12/12 sets):** `{\"schema\":\"huntress.mobile.puzzle.v2\",\"day\":N,\"codec\":\n28\t  \"analysis\",\"build\":\"<12 hex>\"}` -- NO `data`. The answer is `Release.code(Context)` evaluated statically (see Day 23).\n29\t  Older days' Mastery sets were REGENERATED in v2 (d02/d06/d10/d14/d15/d22 all `analysis`), not replayed from v1.\n30\t- **Since d15 Mastery is a MIXED-DAY bundle** (d15-d21 5 sets, d22 6, d23 7 ... d27 11, d28 TWELVE: +1/day since d22),\n31\t  all under today's prompt. Solve each set from its own APK; never assume the set count or the schema.\n32\t- **Old days regenerated as v2 now carry their REAL mechanic as code** (d25): d19 set = genuine `Class.forName` /\n33\t  `getDeclaredMethod` / `Method.invoke` dispatch; d16 set = the u16 length-narrowing gate inside the native export; d14 set\n34\t  LCG table; d15 set JNI hop. d26: d11, d13, d21 arrived as v2 with NO real API (pure chain; solver 