e` = `\"ANS-\"` + 16 nibbles via\n74\t  `\"0123456789ABCDEF\".charAt((v >>> i) & 15)` of `fin(Mix.f1(token())) ^ K`; `proof` = `Long.toHexString(token())`.\n75\t  Rule: INTERPRET from the entry (`Release.code`, the value reaching `proof=`); never key on names; unreferenced\n76\t  look-alike mixers/`K*` consts are the \"generated false positives\".\n77\t- **Answer location** -- puzzle JSON d1-d19 and d21-d23 single (d15-d16 also `.so` `.rodata`); d20 nested asset dex;\n78\t  d23+ TT/Mastery = computed by dex (+ JNI for the d15/d16 sets; + feature-split bytes d26); d26 single = base JSON +\n79\t  feature JSON fragment; d28 single = payload of a framed packet inside the JSON hex. Fallback chain: v2 eval, `raw_entry_scan`, `dex_strings`,\n80\t  `strings -a lib/*/*.so | grep ANS-`, `extract_answer`.\n81\t- **Mastery set mix (d15+)** -- fixtures of DIFFERENT days (codec/schema, theme, package `dNN`, extra entries); JSON `day`\n82\t  and dex `DAY` name the source day; picks re-roll per attempt; last set = today's (d24: d03 d06 d09 d10+NSC d15+.so d17\n83\t  d23 d24; d25: d01 d04 d07 d10+NSC d14 d16+.so d19 d22 d25; d26: d02 d03 d06 d11 d13 d16+.so d19 d21 d25 d26.apks;\n84\t  d27 all v1: d01 plain, d04 xor, d07 caesar, d10 split+NSC, d11 xor, d14 caesar, d18 xor, d20 dynamic+payload.dex,\n85\t  d21 reverse, d26.apks split+feature JSON, d27 base64; d28 all v2: d01 d04 d07 d08 d11 d14 d17 d18 d22 d24\n86\t  d26.apks d28 -- d08, d17, d18 first time as v2, d17/d18 RUN their mechanic). d16 the question's case ref did NOT\n87\t  match the APK (d23 they matched). Rule: per-set, schema-agnostic decoding -- never branch on the day or case ref.\n88\t- **Mastery packaging** -- `delivery N: <name>_mastery_NN.apk|.apks` per set (2-digit `NN`, up to `12` d28): pair by\n89\t  sha256, never by extension. 3, 5, 6, 7 (d23) ... 10 (d26), 11 (d27), 12 (d28) sets, ids `setN.answer` (submission dict order is\n90\t  not set order). Loop over answer_ids.\n91\t- **Per-variant identity** -- case ref `MOB-NN-<10 hex>`, package suffix `v<12 hex>`, `client_secret`, attempt slug, v2\n92\t  `build`. None fed the answer so far (watch `build`: a natural future seed).\n93\t- **Dex hint strings** -- v1 single dex: `CODEC`, `CONTROL`, `DAY-NN:<theme>:<mechanic>`, `describe`; d17-d22 + d27 TT\n94\t  (2.68 KB) dropped the tag/`describe` and added `STRUCTURAL`, int `DAY` and the mechanic stub (`decryptByte`,\n95\t  `dispatch`, `debuggerGate`, `rootSignals`, `exportedReachability`) -- never called by ChallengeActivity. v2 dex (5.3-6.2 KB vs ~2.6 KB): `CODEC=\"analysis\"`, `CONTROL`, int `DAY`, old\n96\t  days keep `describe()`. Rule: never require `CODEC`/`DAY-NN` to find or decode anything.\n97\t- **Manifest flags (d21)** -- `debuggable=\"true\"` only on d21 APKs; changed nothing. Record as facts; branch only if code\n98\t  reads `ApplicationInfo.flags`/`BuildConfig.DEBUG`.\n99\t- **Native lib shape (d15-d16, d23-d25 v2 sets)** -- d15 literal lib; d16 TT gate `nativeEvidence(int)`; v2 d15 set: 13512 B\n100\t  lib exporting only `Java_<pkg>_NativeLibrarySecrets_nativeShare` + `huntress_arena_day`; v2 d16 set (d25): 13648 B,\n101\t  `nativeShare(JI)J` + `nativeEvidence` + `huntress_arena_length_accepts`, gate on the int arg. No `ANS-` literal in v2\n102\t  libs. Never key on export names, arity or lib size: mangle the JNI name from the dex `native` method, emulate it.\n103\t\n104\t## Recognition cues -> first move"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d21e4ad2-2ce4-4150-a62f-2e8aa1a9e184","uuid":"e60bb231-b129-4f35-95a9-69a0337f698f","timestamp":"2026-10-28T13:11:00.560Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/testpwn/huntress-2026/reference/techniques/mobile-android.md","content":"## Variant axes (what differs between the single, Time Trial and Mastery variants -- parse every value listed)\n- **Puzzle schema (d23-d27)** -- v1 in the single, v2 `analysis` (no `data`, field `build`) in TT and in ALL Mastery\n  sets incl. old days (d23 7/7 ... d26 10